00:12:57.570 --> 00:12:58.995
So I'm going to go pretty fast.

00:12:58.995 --> 00:12:59.620
All right, so--

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:01.360
[LAUGHTER]

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:03.400
Yeah, we just found out
